        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "**Note:** all 40 sprint issues in this demo dataset were created moments ago as part of a seed script, so system `created`/`resolutiondate` timestamps are effectively identical across every issue. A true trend-analysis-over-time panel (issues created/resolved per week) and the lead/cycle time figure above have nothing meaningful to show yet with this seed data -- that's a data-recency limitation of the demo dataset, not a Jira/Grafana limitation, and mirrors the source doc's own point that reporting quality depends on real data maturity."
